  "description": {
    "en": "The kitchen's forecast and prep list (W-PREP, P6 of docs/research/2026-10-03-depth-stock-analytics-models.md; K14). GET /api/staff/kitchen/prep?day=yyyy-mm-dd (today..today+6, strict query: day, location_id), opened to the owner and to staff holding stock or catalog (guard::NUMBERS). The venue object folds the daily sales cube (W-HIST) plus the hot log: per weekday x hour band (opening-14:00, 14:00-18:00, 18:00-close, cut by the venue's hours), the median of the last 3..8 same weekdays (fewer than 3: learning, value null, never a number); a dish whose samples are more than a third zeros uses TSB. The error is measured: each of the 28 days before today forecast as of that day vs what sold, beside the seasonal-naive guess (same weekday a week before): offBy = mean absolute error in portions, masePm = model error / naive error per mille. Dish portions + tonight's bookings x the usual basket are expanded through the recipes (dowiz_hub::prep::expand) into ПФ need, ПФ ready on the shelf (stock::basket::ready_micro, read only), ПФ to make with its raw components, and the day's raw total. No money and no person in the answer.",
    "uk": "Прогноз кухні та список заготовок: медіана того ж дня тижня (менше 3 тижнів - навчається), похибка виміряна за 4 тижні поруч із наївним прогнозом, напівфабрикати мінус готове на полиці плюс бронювання."
  },
